==================================================
CRITICAL TEMPORAL RULE
==================================================

For a row representing:

PLAYER X — GW N

ALL FEATURES must represent information available BEFORE the GW N deadline.

The target represents what actually happened DURING GW N.

Example:

Prediction snapshot:

Player: Haaland
Gameweek: GW10
Deadline: before GW10

Allowed features:

- minutes in GW9 and earlier
- starts in GW9 and earlier
- goals/xG in GW9 and earlier
- assists/xA in GW9 and earlier
- FPL points in GW9 and earlier
- price before GW10
- team before GW10
- opponent for GW10
- home/away for GW10
- fixture information known before GW10
- injury/suspension information available before the deadline IF historically available in the dataset

Target:

- actual GW10 minutes
- actual GW10 started/not-started
- actual GW10 60+ minutes
- actual GW10 0 minutes

FORBIDDEN:

- GW10 minutes as an input
- GW10 points as an input
- GW10 goals as an input
- GW10 assists as an input
- GW10 BPS as an input
- GW10 post-match statistics
- GW11+ information
- future price changes
- future transfers
- future results
- any post-deadline information

